###  http://SustainHealthyFoodOntology#Adrenaline
shf:Adrenaline rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                        shf:Hormone ;
               shf:hasEffectOn "preparing the body for its “fight or flight” response and allows for quick decision making in dangerous or stressful situations" ;
               rdf:label "Adrenaline" ;
               rdfs:comment "Also called epinephrine, it is released mainly during stress or danger. It increases heart rate, breathing, blood pressure, and energy availability as part of the “fight-or-flight” response." .


