###  http://SustainHealthyFoodOntology#Thyroid_Hormone
shf:Thyroid_Hormone rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                             shf:Hormone ;
                    shf:hasEffectOn "Regulating metabolism and heart rate." ;
                    rdf:label "Thyroid Hormone" ;
                    rdfs:comment "A general term for the hormones T3 and T4, which are produced by the thyroid gland. They help regulate metabolism, energy use, body temperature, heart activity, growth, and development." .


