shf:GlutenFreeDiet rdfs:comment "A gluten-free diet excludes gluten, a protein naturally found in wheat, barley, and rye. It is the main treatment for celiac disease and may also be needed for non-celiac gluten sensitivity or certain wheat-related conditions." ;
                   rdfs:label "GlutenFreeDiet"@en .


